---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pricing — Fornax">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>Simple, transparent pricing</h1>
    <p class="tagline">No free trial, no site or lead limits shown here, no surprises. Your plan is matched to your business by our lead scoring — you see your tier with your demo, not a picker.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing">
    <div class="pricing-cards">
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h3>Micro</h3>
        <div class="price">$149<span class="price-unit">/mo</span></div>
        <p class="price-subtitle">or $1,490/year (2 months free) · or $499 one-time (Offboard)</p>
        <p class="price-audience">Solo contractors, under 3 employees</p>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>✅ Professional site, 6-8 sections</li>
          <li>✅ Contact form with email lead alerts</li>
          <li>✅ Lead inbox and CSV export</li>
          <li>✅ Google reviews on your site</li>
          <li>✅ Edit your text, contact info and images</li>
          <li>✅ Hosting, SSL, custom domain</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/demo" class="button button-secondary">Get my demo</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card pricing-card-featured">
        <div class="badge">Most popular</div>
        <h3>SMB</h3>
        <div class="price">$249<span class="price-unit">/mo</span></div>
        <p class="price-subtitle">or $2,490/year (2 months free) · or $799 one-time (Offboard)</p>
        <p class="price-audience">Established trades, 3-20 employees, $250k-$5M revenue</p>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>✅ Everything in Micro</li>
          <li>✅ Gallery, map, FAQ, seasonal offers, team profiles</li>
          <li>✅ Your colors and fonts within a design profile</li>
          <li>✅ Notes and a simple pipeline in your dashboard</li>
          <li>✅ CRM sync (HubSpot at launch; more CRMs planned)</li>
          <li>✅ Monthly search optimization</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/demo" class="button button-primary">Get my demo</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card pricing-card-paused">
        <div class="badge badge-muted">Paused ~12 months</div>
        <h3>Mid-Market</h3>
        <div class="price">$399<span class="price-unit">/mo</span></div>
        <p class="price-subtitle">or $3,990/year · or $1,299 one-time (Offboard)</p>
        <p class="price-audience">Multi-location and larger trades operations</p>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>✅ Everything in SMB</li>
          <li>✅ Multi-location, custom pipeline, lead scoring</li>
          <li>✅ Multiple CRMs</li>
          <li>➖ Not built yet — shown here for roadmap visibility only</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/demo" class="button button-secondary">Join the waitlist</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="pricing-note">
      <strong>Managed</strong> means we host, maintain, and support your site — hosting, SSL, security updates and backups included.
      <strong>Offboard</strong> means you pay once, take the domain and files, and host it yourself with no ongoing support.
      Annual plans are billed once, non-refundable and not prorated on cancellation. Monthly plans get a 30-day pro-rata refund,
      or a full refund for a billing error or a 24+ hour unplanned outage reported within 7 days.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="addons">
    <h2>Add-ons</h2>
    <div class="addons-grid">
      <div class="addon">
        <h4>Professional Redesign</h4>
        <p>$199 for layout tweaks, $299 for 2-3 sections, $499 for a full custom redesign. Human-executed — this is a waitlist item, not instant.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="addon">
        <h4>Annual billing</h4>
        <p>Pay for 10 months, get 12. One payment, non-refundable if you cancel early.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq">
    <h2>Pricing FAQ</h2>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>Do I choose my tier?</h4>
      <p>No. Lead scoring assigns your tier based on your business, and you see it with your demo before you pay anything.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>Is there a free trial?</h4>
      <p>No. There's no free trial. You see your actual site and dashboard in the demo before you're asked to pay.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>What happens if I cancel?</h4>
      <p>Monthly plans: cancel any time, access continues to the end of the paid month, and a 30-day pro-rata refund applies. Annual plans: one payment, non-refundable and not prorated; access stops at cancellation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>What's the difference between Managed and Offboard?</h4>
      <p>Managed is a subscription — we host and maintain everything. Offboard is a one-time payment — you take the domain and files and run it yourself, with no ongoing support from us.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>Will prices change?</h4>
      <p>Prices are expected to rise soon after launch for new customers. Existing customers keep their price at signup.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-footer">
    <h2>Ready to see your price in action?</h2>
    <p>Request a demo and we'll show you your actual site, your dashboard, and your tier.</p>
    <a href="/demo" class="button button-primary">Get my demo</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .tagline {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .pricing, .addons, .faq, .cta-footer {
    padding: 40px 20px 60px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .addons h2, .faq h2, .cta-footer h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  .pricing-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    border: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing-card-featured {
    border-color: #dc2626;
  }

  .pricing-card-paused {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 20px;
    background: #dc2626;
    color: white;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .badge-muted {
    background: #999;
  }

  .pricing-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #dc2626;
    margin: 16px 0 8px;
  }

  .price-unit {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #999;
  }

  .price-subtitle {
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .price-audience {
    color: #999;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .features li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    margin-top: 32px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .addons-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .addon {
    padding: 24px;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .addon h4 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .addon p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .faq-item h4 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-footer {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }

  .button {
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: #dc2626;
    color: white;
  }

  .button-primary:hover {
    background: #b91c1c;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: white;
    color: #333;
    border: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .button-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #dc2626;
    color: #dc2626;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
